        "cooked": "<p>I’ve never seen any movie in a theater more than twice; you just can’t drag me out to a theater more than that. I have several movies I’ve seen twice, though.</p>\n<p>The inverse of the weirdest movie watching situation I ever had is when I won free tickets to see Star Trek: Into Darkness. Because of the ticket restrictions I had to go on a Tuesday morning at the far tail end of the run so I was literally the only person in the theater. It was little creepy even for my introvert tastes; I think like maybe 5-10 or so other people is the sweet spot there.</p>",
